ricator\">Blueprints Fabricator</a>, which can also be found at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>.\n</p><p>Can store data for builds to sell to players.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n<small>Special thanks to Noodles (@Creeper249yt) for creating this page!</small>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902062206\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 56/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 61/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019401/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.888      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   29.888      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2975-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902062206 and revision id 17597. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Objects"],"links":[{"title":"Blueprint Fabricator","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true}],"images":["Blueprints.png"]}
